    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <section id="how">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
        <h2>Fifteen minutes to set up. Then it just arrives.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          You don't need a developer, and you don't need to learn anything. If you can install an
          app on your store, you're done.
        </p>

        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="badge">1</div>
            <h3>You connect your accounts</h3>
            <p>
              One click to install on Shopify, then link your Google and Meta ad accounts. We ask
              for read-only access, which means we can look but never change anything.
            </p>
            <div class="time">About 15 minutes, once</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="badge">2</div>
            <h3>We check the numbers</h3>
            <p>
              We pull the last 13 months and check our totals against what Shopify and your ad
              platforms show. If anything doesn't match, we find out why before you ever see it.
            </p>
            <div class="time">A few days, first time only</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="badge">3</div>
            <h3>You get a report and a call</h3>
            <p>
              First week of every month. A short PDF, a summary you can paste into WhatsApp, and a
              call to talk through what to change. Then we check next month whether it worked.
            </p>
            <div class="time">Every month</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ph" style="min-height:340px;margin-top:36px">
          <div class="lbl">Image placeholder</div>
          <div class="name">dashboard-screenshot.png</div>
