    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section id="faq">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Common questions</div>
        <h2>Things people ask before starting.</h2>

        <div class="faqs">
          <div class="faq">
            <h3>Do I need to be technical to use this?</h3>
            <p>
              No. Setup is installing an app and clicking through two permission screens. After that
              you receive a PDF and get on a call. There's nothing to learn and nothing to log into
              unless you want to.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq">
            <h3>What access do you need, exactly?</h3>
            <p>
              Read-only access to your Shopify store and your Google and Meta ad accounts. We can see
              orders, products and ad spend. We can't change anything, we can't spend your money, and
              we don't collect your customers' names or email addresses at all.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq">
            <h3>I already pay for an analytics tool. Why this too?</h3>
            <p>
              Those tools show you numbers. This one reads them and tells you what to change. Most
              people who switch tell us the old dashboard was open twice a month and never led to a
              decision.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq">
            <h3>What if your numbers don't match what I see in Shopify?</h3>
            <p>
              We check that before you do. Every report is compared against Shopify and your ad
              platforms first, and where there's a difference we explain it in the report itself.
              Some differences are normal — Meta revises recent days, for example — and we'd rather
              tell you than have you find it.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq">
            <h3>How long until I get something useful?</h3>
            <p>
              Your first report lands within about a week of connecting. It's free, and it covers a
              full month with a call to go through it.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq">
            <h3>What if I want to stop?</h3>
            <p>
              Tell us and we stop. Billing is quarterly, there's no contract, and we'll delete your
              data on request.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq">
            <h3>Do you work with agencies?</h3>
            <p>
              Yes. If you manage ads for several brands, we can report on all of them and you can put
              your own name on it. Get in touch and we'll work out the pricing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
